清晰锐利。\n\n背景为米白色哑光宣纸质感，画面点缀浅金色细线手绘越南传统人文元素：左侧是身着奥黛、头戴斗笠的女性侧身轮廓线稿，右侧是水面上戴斗笠划船的人物线稿；画面底部左右搭配水彩风格的莲花、荷叶与热带散尾葵叶片，色调柔和清新，花叶层次自然，充满越南传统人文气息。\n\n画面顶部居中放置深墨绿色优雅衬线字体的越南文「Bóng hoa dệt bạc」，字间距舒展，排版协调克制，不遮挡产品主体。\n\n整体采用柔和均匀的顶侧自然光，光影干净通透，精准还原磨砂银的细腻颗粒感与抛光边缘的微弱高光，水彩植物呈现清透温润的质感。8K 超高清，画面整洁无多余杂物，整体氛围温婉高级，越南传统文化氛围浓郁，传统工艺与现代轻奢审美融合。", "empty", false, 1394026592, "randomize", "1k"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10", "label": "image10", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image10"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "